<title>USA: Ginnie Mae sets $300 million REMIC G061.</title>
<headline>Ginnie Mae sets $300 million REMIC G061.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government National Mortgage Association (Ginnie Mae or GNMA) on Monday said it issued $300 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC G061, issued via Bear Stearns Cos Inc, is backed by mortgage certificates from pool C043, Ginnie Mae said.</p>
<p>The issue priced on April 2 and has a settlement date of April 30, the agency said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
